-- חוזר לבעלויות תשע"ה/3 (22.4.2015) — רכז התאמות ללמידה והיבחנות, ותגמול
-- עבודה עם תלמידים לקויי למידה, בחטיבות העליונות שבהן לא מונהגת עוז לתמורה
-- Under the National Labour Court's judgment of 23.2.2015: in upper
-- divisions not yet under Oz LeTmura, a learning-and-examination
-- adjustments coordinator must be appointed (6% role allowance, its base,
-- the third-of-a-position condition, from 24.2.2015, the summer months, the
-- management hours); and teachers are paid in allowance units for work with
-- pupils with learning disabilities outside their position's hours.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common

§ `חוזר לבעלויות תשע"ה/3 — רכז התאמות ותגמול לקויי למידה`

-- akn:preamble The letterhead, date (22.4.2015), reference, number, addressee, greeting and subject lines; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p14 The source: the agreements reached between the Ministry, the Treasury, the local-authorities centre and the teachers' organisation, set in the National Labour Court's judgment of 23.2.2015; the terms follow.
-- akn:preamble/p15 akn:preamble/p16 akn:preamble/p17 Points to the judgment's other decisions, at a web address broken over two lines; no rule of this circular.

-- Dates are numbers YYYYMMDD.
`24 February 2015` MEANS 20150224

DECLARE `adjustments action` IS ONE OF
    `appoint an adjustments coordinator`
    `allot role hours for the coordinator`
    `allot management hours to the coordinator` HAS `management hours allotted` IS A NUMBER
    `pay the role allowance` HAS `role allowance paid` IS A NUMBER

@desc The salary components the circular names as the base of both payments: the combined salary and the '94, 2001, 2008, 2011 and 2011-erosion supplements.
DECLARE `salary base` HAS
    `combined salary`             IS A NUMBER
    `the '94 supplement`          IS A NUMBER
    `the 2001 supplement`         IS A NUMBER
    `the 2008 supplement`         IS A NUMBER
    `the 2011 supplement`         IS A NUMBER
    `the 2011 erosion supplement` IS A NUMBER

GIVEN b IS A `salary base`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the base total` b IS
    b's `combined salary`
    PLUS b's `the '94 supplement`
    PLUS b's `the 2001 supplement`
    PLUS b's `the 2008 supplement`
    PLUS b's `the 2011 supplement`
    PLUS b's `the 2011 erosion supplement`

§§ `1. רכז התאמות ללמידה והיבחנות`

-- 1 ¶1-¶3: in upper divisions where Oz LeTmura is not yet implemented, a
-- coordinator of learning and examination adjustments must be appointed
-- in the school, the role parallel to the Oz LeTmura coordinator's. The
-- clarification (2 ¶18-¶19): in Oz LeTmura upper divisions too the
-- appointment is obligatory, and that coordinator's pay is the Oz LeTmura
-- agreement's (circular תשע"ב/7, 17(א)), outside this circular. The
-- circular sets no deadline, so the duty has none.
@ref akn:art_1 akn:art_1/p2 akn:art_1/p3 akn:art_2/p18 akn:art_2/p19
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `adjustments action`
DECIDE `an adjustments coordinator is appointed` IS
    PARTY `the local authority or owning body`
    MUST  `appoint an adjustments coordinator`
    LEST  BREACH BY `the local authority or owning body` BECAUSE "circular תשע\"ה/3 section 1: every upper division must have a learning-and-examination adjustments coordinator"

-- 1(א): a role allowance of 6% of the salary that is the base for the
-- subject coordinator's allowance (the components above). 1(ב): computed on
-- one full position, provided the teacher holds at least a third of a
-- position; pension-fund contributions are made on it.
@ref akn:art_1__para_a akn:art_1__para_b
GIVEN b IS A `salary base` @desc the components for a full position
      `position` IS A NUMBER @desc the teacher's position (1 = 100%)
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the monthly role allowance` b `position` IS
    IF `position` AT LEAST 1 DIVIDED BY 3
    THEN `the adjustments coordinator's rate` TIMES `the base total` b
    ELSE 0

`the adjustments coordinator's rate` MEANS 6%

@ref akn:art_1__para_b
`pension-fund contributions are made on the role allowance` MEANS TRUE

-- 1(ג): entitled from the appointment and not before 24.2.2015; in the
-- summer month(s) the allowance is paid in part, by the period served in
-- the role. F-2014-15_tashae_03-a: "the period" is read as the months
-- served out of the ten months of the school year (September to June).
@ref akn:art_1__para_c
GIVEN `date` IS A NUMBER @desc YYYYMMDD
      `appointed on` IS A NUMBER @desc YYYYMMDD
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the role allowance is due` `date` `appointed on` IF
    `date` AT LEAST `appointed on` AND `date` AT LEAST `24 February 2015`

GIVEN `full monthly allowance` IS A NUMBER, `months served` IS A NUMBER, `months the period is measured against` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the summer-month allowance` `full monthly allowance` `months served` `months the period is measured against` IS
    `full monthly allowance` TIMES min 1 (`months served` DIVIDED BY `months the period is measured against`)

-- The reading adopted: out of the school year's ten months.
GIVEN `full monthly allowance` IS A NUMBER, `months served` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the summer-month allowance as read` `full monthly allowance` `months served` IS
    `the summer-month allowance` `full monthly allowance` `months served` 10

-- F-2014-15_tashae_03-a: a coordinator appointed on 24.2.2015 serves about
-- 4 months of the school year (to June) or about 6 of the calendar months
-- to August; the measures give different summer pay.
`the summer measures differ` MEANS
    NOT (`the summer-month allowance` 600 4 10 EQUALS `the summer-month allowance` 600 6 12)
#ASSERT `the summer measures differ`

-- 1(ד): the principal may allot hours from the school's management-hours
-- basket to the role where he finds it needed and an unused balance
-- exists; the Ministry allots no role hours for it.
@ref akn:art_1__para_d
GIVEN `the principal finds it needed` IS A BOOLEAN
      `unused management hours` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `adjustments action`
DECIDE `management hours for the coordinator` `the principal finds it needed` `unused management hours` IS
    IF `the principal finds it needed` AND `unused management hours` GREATER THAN 0
    THEN PARTY `the school principal`
         MAY   `allot management hours to the coordinator` h
               PROVIDED h AT MOST `unused management hours`
    ELSE FULFILLED

@ref akn:art_1__para_d
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `adjustments action`
DECIDE `no role hours from the Ministry` IS
    PARTY `the Ministry of Education`
    SHANT `allot role hours for the coordinator`
    LEST  BREACH BY `the Ministry of Education` BECAUSE "circular תשע\"ה/3, 1(ד): the Ministry allots no role hours for the adjustments coordinator"

§§ `2. תגמול עבודה עם תלמידים לקויי למידה`

-- 2 ¶1-¶2: from 24.2.2015, in upper divisions not yet under Oz LeTmura,
-- teachers are paid for work with pupils with learning disabilities in
-- hours beyond those of their position, by the mechanism of section 2(א)(1)
-- of the wage director's letter of 5.1.2009 (operated in תשס"ט-תשע"א).
@ref akn:art_2 akn:art_2/p2
GIVEN `date` IS A NUMBER @desc YYYYMMDD
      `the school is under Oz LeTmura` IS A BOOLEAN
      `beyond the position's hours` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the work earns allowance units` `date` `the school is under Oz LeTmura` `beyond the position's hours` IF
        `date` AT LEAST `24 February 2015`
    AND NOT `the school is under Oz LeTmura`
    AND `beyond the position's hours`

-- ¶3-¶13: the table — units by the kind of action and the pupils.
@ref akn:art_2/p3 akn:art_2/p4 akn:art_2/p5 akn:art_2/p6 akn:art_2/p7 akn:art_2/p8 akn:art_2/p9 akn:art_2/p10 akn:art_2/p11 akn:art_2/p12 akn:art_2/p13
`the units table` MEANS
    LIST `units row` `extra time in the examination, the teacher present` TRUE 1,
         `units row` `reading the examination paper to the pupil or pupils` TRUE 1,
         `units row` `an oral examination` FALSE 1,
         `units row` `the pupil dictating answers to the teacher` FALSE 1.25,
         `units row` `transcribing the pupil's answers` FALSE 1.25

DECLARE `adjustment action` IS ONE OF
    `extra time in the examination, the teacher present`
    `reading the examination paper to the pupil or pupils`
    `an oral examination`
    `the pupil dictating answers to the teacher`
    `transcribing the pupil's answers`

DECLARE `units row` HAS
    `row action`            IS AN `adjustment action`
    `a group may be served` IS A BOOLEAN @desc the row reads "a single pupil or a group" rather than "a single pupil"
    `row units`             IS A NUMBER

GIVEN a IS AN `adjustment action`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the units for` a IS
    sum (map (GIVEN r YIELD r's `row units`)
             (filter (GIVEN r YIELD r's `row action` EQUALS a) `the units table`))

-- ¶14: a unit is 0.5% of the salary base (the components above).
@ref akn:art_2/p14
`the value of a unit` MEANS 0.5%

@export default The payment to a teacher, in an upper division not under Oz LeTmura, for one adjustment action with pupils with learning disabilities under owners' circular 2014-15/3
GIVEN a IS AN `adjustment action` @desc the kind of action
      b IS A `salary base` @desc the teacher's combined salary and the '94, 2001, 2008, 2011 and 2011-erosion supplements
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the payment for the action` a b IS
    `the units for` a TIMES `the value of a unit` TIMES `the base total` b

-- ¶15-¶17: the other rules of the payment are in circular תשס"ט/4, section
-- 2, at the address given — not reproduced here, an input to anyone
-- applying them.
-- akn:art_2/p15 akn:art_2/p16 akn:art_2/p17 Points to circular תשס"ט/4 section 2 for the other rules, at a web address broken over two lines; no rule of this circular.

-- akn:conclusions The greeting, the signature (Sonia Peretz) and the list of copies; no rule.

§§ `Worked examples`

-- The salary components are placeholders, not from a payslip.
`a teacher's base` MEANS
    `salary base` WITH
        `combined salary`             IS 8000
        `the '94 supplement`          IS 400
        `the 2001 supplement`         IS 300
        `the 2008 supplement`         IS 500
        `the 2011 supplement`         IS 600
        `the 2011 erosion supplement` IS 200

#ASSERT `the base total` `a teacher's base` EQUALS 10000
#ASSERT `the monthly role allowance` `a teacher's base` 0.5 EQUALS 600
#ASSERT `the monthly role allowance` `a teacher's base` 0.25 EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the payment for the action` `transcribing the pupil's answers` `a teacher's base` EQUALS 62.5
#ASSERT `the payment for the action` `an oral examination` `a teacher's base` EQUALS 50
#ASSERT NOT `the role allowance is due` 20150201 20140901
#ASSERT `the role allowance is due` 20150301 20140901
#ASSERT `the summer-month allowance as read` 600 4 EQUALS 240
#ASSERT `the work earns allowance units` 20150301 FALSE TRUE

#TRACE `an adjustments coordinator is appointed` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the local authority or owning body` DOES `appoint an adjustments coordinator` AT 1
#TRACE `management hours for the coordinator` TRUE 3 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the school principal` DOES `allot management hours to the coordinator` 2 AT 1
